WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.167
(light ambient music)
(water flowing)

00:00:12.893 --> 00:00:17.883
- Catching the fish is
definitely the biggest element.

00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:19.851
Favorite part is always the take.

00:00:19.851 --> 00:00:21.819
You know, when the fish takes the fly,

00:00:21.819 --> 00:00:23.902
adrenaline just goes off.

00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:28.471
Just casting, minding your own business,

00:00:28.471 --> 00:00:30.183
then all of a sudden, boom!

00:00:30.183 --> 00:00:32.533
(chuckles) That's a lot of fun.

00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:36.700
(light ambient music)
(water flowing)

00:00:38.987 --> 00:00:42.294
We are at Tungufljót,
which is a central river

00:00:42.294 --> 00:00:44.857
on the south coast of Iceland.

00:00:44.857 --> 00:00:47.717
This river is known for very big fish.

00:00:47.717 --> 00:00:49.848
I think it's because of all the glaciers,

00:00:49.848 --> 00:00:52.165
and this is fairly new geologically

00:00:52.165 --> 00:00:54.498
on this part of the country.

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:04.643
It's fun being fishing
in this kind of weather.

00:01:07.463 --> 00:01:09.481
Once you have your first fish

00:01:09.481 --> 00:01:11.558
it starts to be a lot more about

00:01:11.558 --> 00:01:14.475
the nature, the river, the company.

00:01:18.907 --> 00:01:21.391
And being outside, getting away

00:01:21.391 --> 00:01:23.891
from your normal life, really,

00:01:25.741 --> 00:01:29.908
doing something else for
two or three days or a week.

00:01:32.195 --> 00:01:34.445
That's what it's all about.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:44.715
Fly fishing offers a never-ending journey,

00:01:44.715 --> 00:01:47.105
so to speak, although it sounds a cliché,

00:01:47.105 --> 00:01:48.833
you're never gonna master it,

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:50.536
no matter how hard you try,

00:01:50.536 --> 00:01:52.254
no matter how much time
you spend doing it,

00:01:52.254 --> 00:01:54.780
you're never, ever gonna master it.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:58.030
(light ambient music)

